# The Rootcore (CIPlay the_rootcore): the core valves refused before the Blightmother falls; then BURN (alone, with
# no Heart choice held, either valve works); the second valve refused after.
island The Rootcore
# RESIZE 10-24: the recipe moved this island's old content by 0 22; the points below are in the old frame
offset 0 -22
expect step 0
expect title The Core
zone mouth
expect step 1
read Expedition sign
expect step 2
zone dome
expect step 3
use coreburn
expect story core 0
kill Warthog
expect step 4
use firebasket1
use firebasket2
kill Mama bear
zone old_root
expect step 6
read The Ringwave root
expect step 7
# REDO 10-24: the valves wait for the three heart shards set into the oldest root
use coreburn
expect story core 0
use oldroot
expect story rootlit 0
open Mushroom ring
open Overgrown chest
use dvines
expect shown dvinechest
open Behind the vines
wait 2
expect story shard 3
expect step 8
use oldroot
expect story shard 0
expect story rootlit 1
expect step 9
use coreburn
expect story core 1
expect shown embers
expect shown heartseed
use coreopen
expect hidden glowgrowth
expect step 10
read The core
expect step 11
use heartseed
expect story heartseed 1
use rangerlock
expect hidden rangercache
expect step 12
zone oda_camp
expect step 13
read Oda Fenn's farewell
expect done
